# ===== Server settings for droptaxinow.in (copy to your host's environment; NEVER commit real values) =====
PORT=4000
# Where enquiries/bookings (JSON lines), coupons.json and the dev email outbox are stored. Mount a persistent volume here.
DATA_DIR=/data

# --- Email (use the same SMTP account you use for Drop1Taxi, or a new mailbox such as bookings@droptaxinow.in) ---
SMTP_HOST=smtp.example.com
SMTP_PORT=587            # 587 = STARTTLS, 465 = SSL
SMTP_SECURE=false        # true for port 465
SMTP_USER=bookings@droptaxinow.in
SMTP_PASS=change-me
MAIL_FROM=bookings@droptaxinow.in
MAIL_FROM_NAME=Drop Taxi Now
MAIL_REPLY_TO=bookings@droptaxinow.in
# Comma separated: who receives NEW ENQUIRY / NEW BOOKING emails
ADMIN_EMAILS=owner@example.com,dispatch@example.com

# --- Google Maps Platform ---
# Enable: Places API (New), Routes API, Geocoding API. Without a key the site uses the built-in South India city list and offline distance table.
# Prefer a key restricted by server IP. A website(referrer)-restricted key also works because the server sends GOOGLE_MAPS_REFERER.
GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_KEY=
GOOGLE_MAPS_REFERER=https://droptaxinow.in/

# --- Security ---
# Long random string. Signs fare quotes so prices cannot be tampered with in the browser.
QUOTE_SECRET=change-me-to-a-long-random-string

# --- Optional instant alerts ---
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=

# --- LATER: connect to the Drop1Taxi admin panel (leave empty to keep it OFF) ---
ADMIN_SYNC_ENQUIRY_URL=      # e.g. https://drop1taxi.com/api/send-enquiry.php
ADMIN_SYNC_CONFIRM_URL=      # e.g. https://drop1taxi.com/api/confirm_booking.php
ADMIN_SYNC_TOKEN=
ADMIN_SYNC_TOKEN_HEADER=X-DROPCARS-TOKEN
